597
00:25:59,350 --> 00:25:59,960
Order!

598
00:26:00,680 --> 00:26:02,540
Go help stabilize the situation.

599
00:26:05,030 --> 00:26:06,630
Let me emphasize this again:

600
00:26:07,030 --> 00:26:08,160
