609
00:26:24,400 --> 00:26:26,330
Mentor, you're actually useless.

610
00:26:26,560 --> 00:26:27,480
We're all useless.

611
00:26:27,480 --> 00:26:29,210
We're all good-for-nothings.

612
00:26:30,030 --> 00:26:31,310
The evidence is conclusive.

613
00:26:31,310 --> 00:26:32,970
The consequences are severe.

614
00:26:33,240 --> 00:26:34,120
If we don't execute him,

615
00:26:34,120 --> 00:26:35,720
the public anger cannot be appeased.

616
00:26:35,720 --> 00:26:37,240
Well said! Well said!

617
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:39,720
Good, good!

618
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,880
Good, good!

619
00:26:42,240 --> 00:26:43,640
Order! Order!

620
00:26:43,720 --> 00:26:44,830
Order!

621
00:26:45,590 --> 00:26:46,250
Defendant,

622
00:26:46,790 --> 00:26:49,750
