626
00:26:57,030 --> 00:26:57,720
I...

627
00:27:09,480 --> 00:27:10,160
I...

628
00:27:11,640 --> 00:27:12,500
I plead guilty.

629
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:18,980
No chance of winning now.

630
00:27:18,980 --> 00:27:19,830
What should we do?

631
00:27:19,830 --> 00:27:20,400
Now,

632
00:27:21,070 --> 00:27:24,540
