please present your defense statement.

633
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:27,550
First-time offender, no prior record,

634
00:27:27,550 --> 00:27:29,880
and has good attitude toward confessing.

635
00:27:34,830 --> 00:27:36,240
Respected Presiding Judge,

636
00:27:36,240 --> 00:27:37,440
People's Assessors,

637
00:27:38,110 --> 00:27:40,000
I am entrusted by the defendant,
Qiao Zhiliang,

638
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:40,860
and assigned by

639
00:27:41,020 --> 00:27:43,220
the Nanyu County Legal Advisory Office

640
00:27:43,440 --> 00:27:43,960
