647
00:28:06,350 --> 00:28:07,010
not guilty.

648
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:07,960
Nonsense!

649
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:09,480
You're talking nonsense!

650
00:28:09,750 --> 00:28:10,750
Nonsense!

651
00:28:13,270 --> 00:28:14,880
Well done, Li Xiang!

652
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:15,830
Well done!

653
00:28:24,200 --> 00:28:24,810
Nonsense!

654
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:25,480
Rumor?

655
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:26,900
Sit down!

656
00:28:27,550 --> 00:28:28,280
Sit down!

657
00:28:28,550 --> 00:28:29,920
Step back! Step back!

658
00:28:30,070 --> 00:28:31,160
You guys are committing a crime!

659
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,310
Storming the court is a crime!

660
00:28:32,310 --> 00:28:32,910
Who hit me?

661
00:28:33,680 --> 00:28:35,210
You broke the law, you know?

662
00:28:37,030 --> 00:28:38,480
Step back! Step back!

663
00:28:38,590 --> 00:28:40,040
Scum! Filthy scum!

664
00:28:40,160 --> 00:28:41,110
A lawyer's defense

665
00:28:41,110 --> 00:28:42,750
