666
00:28:42,830 --> 00:28:45,240
is a right!

667
00:28:45,750 --> 00:28:48,400
It is a right granted, recognized,

668
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:51,000
and protected by the law!

669
00:28:52,160 --> 00:28:53,960
Every single one

670
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,510
of you here today

671
00:28:55,830 --> 00:28:57,590
possesses this same right!

672
00:28:59,850 --> 00:29:00,940
I am a lawyer.

673
00:29:01,720 --> 00:29:03,350
Defending the defendant

674
00:29:03,750 --> 00:29:05,130
is my mission!

675
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,030
If one day

676
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:10,750
any of you needs my defense,

677
00:29:11,240 --> 00:29:11,830
I

678
00:29:12,270 --> 00:29:13,550
will not hesitate!

679
00:29:16,720 --> 00:29:18,030
Li Xiang is amazing.

680
00:29:18,350 --> 00:29:20,550
I can't believe Nanyu has such a lawyer.

681
00:29:23,790 --> 00:29:25,250
You're talking nonsense!

682
00:29:25,880 --> 00:29:26,550
Order!

683
00:29:29,110 --> 00:29:30,570
Order! Order in the court!

684
00:29:33,030 --> 00:29:33,720
Order!

685
00:29:38,510 --> 00:29:39,510
Court Pres. Ding.

686
00:29:40,200 --> 00:29:41,120
May I continue?

687
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:42,930
Go ahead.

688
00:29:47,750 --> 00:29:48,680
The core element

689
00:29:49,270 --> 00:29:50,350
of rape

690
00:29:50,880 --> 00:29:52,480
is violating a woman's will—

691
00:29:52,800 --> 00:29:54,930
using violence or other means

692
00:29:54,960 --> 00:29:56,440
to force her into submission

693
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:59,240
and compel her to have sexual intercourse
against her will.

694
00:29:59,240 --> 00:30:00,350
The evidentiary materials

695
00:30:00,350 --> 00:30:02,280
submitted by the prosecutor prove

696
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:03,540
that Qiao Zhiliang

697
00:30:03,630 --> 00:30:04,720
and Wei Sanmei

698
00:30:04,850 --> 00:30:05,770
maintained a stable

699
00:30:05,770 --> 00:30:07,030
and frequent sexual relationship

700
00:30:07,030 --> 00:30:09,310
for nearly four years.

701
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:10,760
The two of them

702
00:30:11,510 --> 00:30:13,160
would meet at least every day or two,

703
00:30:13,160 --> 00:30:15,290
at most every week.

704
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:20,280
Sometimes they even spent
the night together.

705
00:30:25,350 --> 00:30:25,920
Also,

706
00:30:26,590 --> 00:30:27,320
here with me,

707
00:30:27,480 --> 00:30:28,880
I have several love letters

708
00:30:28,880 --> 00:30:31,080
written by Wei Sanmei to Qiao Zhiliang.

709
00:30:31,270 --> 00:30:31,830
Fake.

710
00:30:31,830 --> 00:30:32,920
It must be fake.

711
00:30:33,960 --> 00:30:34,760
Furthermore,

712
00:30:35,480 --> 00:30:37,280
after their affair was exposed,

713
00:30:37,550 --> 00:30:39,270
Wei Sanmei wrote

714
00:30:39,590 --> 00:30:40,920
a letter of confession

715
00:30:41,030 --> 00:30:41,800
to her own aunt—

716
00:30:41,800 --> 00:30:42,640
Wei Aiping,

717
00:30:43,030 --> 00:30:44,270
who was Qiao Zhiliang's wife.

718
00:30:44,270 --> 00:30:46,070
In that letter, she confessed

719
00:30:46,270 --> 00:30:48,440
that she truly loved Qiao Zhiliang.

720
00:30:49,640 --> 00:30:50,440
Let me ask you:

721
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:52,440
if this were rape,

722
00:30:53,740 --> 00:30:54,940
how are these letters

723
00:30:55,350 --> 00:30:56,400
to be explained?

724
00:30:59,400 --> 00:31:00,060
Therefore,

725
00:31:00,510 --> 00:31:01,710
the defense believes

726
00:31:02,440 --> 00:31:03,930
that the defendant, Qiao Zhiliang,

727
00:31:03,930 --> 00:31:05,560
and the victim, Wei Sanmei,

728
00:31:05,590 --> 00:31:07,980
did have an immoral sexual relationship.

729
00:31:08,030 --> 00:31:09,640
But what happened between the two of them

730
00:31:09,640 --> 00:31:10,680
was adultery,

731
00:31:11,110 --> 00:31:12,400
not rape.

732
00:31:12,880 --> 00:31:14,200
Rumors! Nonsense!

733
00:31:17,310 --> 00:31:18,550
He confessed to it himself!

734
00:31:18,550 --> 00:31:19,150
Nonsense!

735
00:31:19,830 --> 00:31:21,290
You're talking nonsense!

736
00:31:22,310 --> 00:31:23,030
Order!

737
00:31:23,440 --> 00:31:24,500
Order in the court!

738
00:31:25,750 --> 00:31:27,580
What was the true cause

739
00:31:27,880 --> 00:31:30,030
of Wei Sanmei's suicide?

740
00:31:31,070 --> 00:31:32,200
After the two of them

741
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:33,030
had their final

742
00:31:33,030 --> 00:31:34,090
sexual encounter,

743
00:31:34,680 --> 00:31:35,910
they were caught in the act.

744
00:31:35,910 --> 00:31:36,630
Qiao Zhiliang

745
00:31:36,630 --> 00:31:37,980
was taken to the public
security authorities.

746
00:31:37,980 --> 00:31:39,500
Wei Sanmei was also locked

747
00:31:39,530 --> 00:31:40,790
at home by her parents.

748
00:31:40,920 --> 00:31:41,510
Although

749
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:42,500
she suffered

750
00:31:42,520 --> 00:31:43,790
immense psychological pressure,

751
00:31:43,790 --> 00:31:45,690
there is sufficient evidence

752
00:31:45,760 --> 00:31:47,030
showing that Wei Sanmei did not

753
00:31:47,030 --> 00:31:48,890
intend to end her life at the time.

754
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:50,350
Instead, she wrote a letter

755
00:31:50,350 --> 00:31:52,880
begging for forgiveness
from Qiao Zhiliang's wife.

756
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:55,480
But Wei Aiping received the letter
and didn't reply.

757
00:31:55,480 --> 00:31:56,400
That night,

758
00:31:56,550 --> 00:31:58,860
Wei Sanmei committed suicide.

759
00:31:59,070 --> 00:31:59,670
Moreover,

760
00:32:00,070 --> 00:32:02,470
Qiao Zhiliang was in detention
at the time.

761
00:32:02,930 --> 00:32:04,960
Qiao Zhiliang bears moral responsibility

762
00:32:04,960 --> 00:32:06,570
for Wei Sanmei's death,

763
00:32:07,000 --> 00:32:08,510
but he is not the real murderer

764
00:32:08,510 --> 00:32:10,590
who killed Wei Sanmei.

765
00:32:12,510 --> 00:32:13,170
Therefore,

766
00:32:14,110 --> 00:32:15,240
the defense submits

767
00:32:15,550 --> 00:32:17,480
that the defendant, Qiao Zhiliang

768
00:32:19,640 --> 00:32:20,440
is not guilty.

769
00:32:22,160 --> 00:32:22,590
Bravo!

770
00:32:26,250 --> 00:32:27,030
Don't push!

771
00:32:34,830 --> 00:32:35,880
Court is adjourned!

772
00:32:35,880 --> 00:32:36,750
I declare

773
00:32:37,000 --> 00:32:38,530
