774
00:32:38,640 --> 00:32:40,100
Move outside. Don't push.

775
00:32:40,680 --> 00:32:41,680
Move, move, move.

776
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:42,550
Yizhong.

777
00:32:43,830 --> 00:32:44,960
Court is adjourned.

778
00:32:45,160 --> 00:32:45,820
Adjourned!

779
00:32:46,270 --> 00:32:47,640
Loyal at heart?

780
00:32:47,750 --> 00:32:48,680
More like a bomb.

781
00:32:49,220 --> 00:32:50,160
You fall into a cesspool

782
00:32:50,160 --> 00:32:51,440
