783
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:52,400
What the hell is this?

784
00:32:52,400 --> 00:32:53,530
Don't hit him! Stop!

785
00:32:54,960 --> 00:32:56,590
This is against the law!

786
00:33:04,030 --> 00:33:05,030
Court Pres. Ding,

787
00:33:06,110 --> 00:33:06,880
we originally thought

788
00:33:06,880 --> 00:33:08,000
Qiao Zhiliang's attitude
in pleading guilty

789
00:33:08,000 --> 00:33:08,880
