792
00:33:11,680 --> 00:33:12,610
But after today,

793
00:33:12,960 --> 00:33:14,350
it has to be the death penalty.

794
00:33:14,350 --> 00:33:15,010
Otherwise,

795
00:33:15,070 --> 00:33:17,330
we will definitely protest the verdict.

796
00:33:17,440 --> 00:33:18,440
Court Pres. Ding.

797
00:33:19,310 --> 00:33:20,370
Have a seat, Mr. Li.

798
00:33:22,070 --> 00:33:22,680
Mr. Li,

799
00:33:24,400 --> 00:33:25,660
are you a Party member?

800
00:33:26,000 --> 00:33:27,550
I joined the Party when I was in the army.

801
00:33:27,550 --> 00:33:29,410
So you're a veteran Party member.

802
00:33:30,200 --> 00:33:32,680
Then how come
you don't understand politics?

803
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:34,480
The public's reaction today,

804
00:33:35,310 --> 00:33:36,110
did you see it?

805
00:33:37,240 --> 00:33:38,240
Court Pres. Ding,

806
00:33:38,240 --> 00:33:39,680
our duty as lawyers...

807
00:33:39,750 --> 00:33:40,880
A lawyer's duty

808
00:33:42,310 --> 00:33:44,310
