809
00:33:46,160 --> 00:33:47,440
Add fuel to the fire?

810
00:33:47,640 --> 00:33:49,740
That was outright malicious agitation.

811
00:33:49,740 --> 00:33:51,000
Don't falsely accuse me.

812
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:51,750
Be responsible for your words.

813
00:33:51,750 --> 00:33:53,010
I'm stating the facts.

814
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:54,880
Enough, enough, enough.

815
00:33:57,480 --> 00:33:58,480
Court Pres. Ding.

816
00:33:58,790 --> 00:33:59,520
In this case,

817
00:33:59,720 --> 00:34:00,720
