of the law

822
00:34:06,510 --> 00:34:08,710
and the bottom line of social morality.

823
00:34:09,670 --> 00:34:10,920
If the court tolerates this

824
00:34:10,920 --> 00:34:12,030
and imposes a lenient sentence,

825
00:34:12,030 --> 00:34:13,110
it will greatly harm

826
00:34:13,110 --> 00:34:14,510
the people's sentiments

827
00:34:14,550 --> 00:34:16,150
and cause a negative impact.

828
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:16,980
Therefore,

829
00:34:17,400 --> 00:34:18,190
we recommend

830
00:34:18,550 --> 00:34:20,659
a swift and severe death penalty.

831
00:34:20,880 --> 00:34:21,230
Yes.

832
00:34:22,480 --> 00:34:23,780
You just said the facts are clear

833
00:34:23,780 --> 00:34:24,679
and the evidence is conclusive.

834
00:34:24,679 --> 00:34:25,440
Then why didn't you collect

835
00:34:25,440 --> 00:34:26,690
the love letters Wei Sanmei wrote

836
00:34:26,690 --> 00:34:27,690
to Qiao Zhiliang?

837
00:34:27,840 --> 00:34:29,070
And that confession letter,

838
00:34:29,070 --> 00:34:30,530
why didn't you collect it?

839
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:33,320
Court Pres. Ding,

840
00:34:34,210 --> 00:34:35,280
do you really not care

841
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:36,360
if your own ruling ends up creating

842
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:37,690
a wrongful conviction?

843
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:49,920
Court Pres. Ding,

844
00:34:50,190 --> 00:34:51,360
