845
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:52,620
If not, we're leaving.

846
00:34:53,590 --> 00:34:55,000
What kind of attitude is that?

847
00:34:55,000 --> 00:34:55,929
Of course we are.

848
00:34:57,150 --> 00:34:57,710
Mr. Li.

849
00:34:58,630 --> 00:34:59,630
Just for a moment,

850
00:35:00,400 --> 00:35:01,630
I'm only asking you

851
00:35:02,150 --> 00:35:04,010
to hold your tongue for now, okay?

852
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:06,150
Then I might as well quit.

853
00:35:06,150 --> 00:35:07,590
Wang Benshan already left anyway.

854
00:35:07,590 --> 00:35:08,480
Just leave the defense bench empty.

855
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:10,210
You can judge however you want.

856
00:35:10,590 --> 00:35:11,190
What?

857
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:13,030
Are you messing with me?

858
00:35:13,030 --> 00:35:13,890
Let me tell you,

859
00:35:14,290 --> 00:35:15,350
at a time like this,

860
00:35:15,430 --> 00:35:16,630
if you act on impulse,

861
00:35:16,970 --> 00:35:17,710
you will really

862
00:35:17,710 --> 00:35:19,240
end up ruining your client.

863
00:35:21,710 --> 00:35:22,710
Court Pres. Ding.

864
00:35:23,630 --> 00:35:24,920
If you can sentence him to death
with a reprieve

865
00:35:24,920 --> 00:35:26,110
or a fixed-term imprisonment,

866
00:35:26,110 --> 00:35:27,970
I guarantee my full cooperation.

867
00:35:28,800 --> 00:35:29,360
What?

868
00:35:30,310 --> 00:35:32,060
You're bargaining here now?

869
00:35:32,430 --> 00:35:34,760
You really think everyone's begging you?

870
00:35:36,030 --> 00:35:37,030
Court Pres. Ding.

871
00:35:37,760 --> 00:35:38,690
It's not up to me.

872
00:35:39,360 --> 00:35:40,070
This case

873
00:35:41,550 --> 00:35:43,810
has to go to the adjudication committee.

874
00:35:47,190 --> 00:35:48,320
Court's adjourned?

875
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:54,630
That fast?

876
00:35:56,590 --> 00:35:58,520
Li Xiang didn't come back with you?

877
00:36:03,030 --> 00:36:03,800
Mr. Wang.

878
00:36:04,550 --> 00:36:05,190
I know

879
00:36:05,630 --> 00:36:07,600
you are not satisfied with Li Xiang.

880
00:36:07,600 --> 00:36:08,280
Look,

881
00:36:08,550 --> 00:36:09,210
from now on,

882
00:36:10,030 --> 00:36:11,230
we can work together.

883
00:36:11,730 --> 00:36:13,000
As for the defense statements
and all that,

884
00:36:13,000 --> 00:36:14,400
I can help you write them.

885
00:36:16,200 --> 00:36:16,920
Is it that I don't know how to write?

886
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:17,500
Or that I'm uneducated?

887
00:36:17,500 --> 00:36:18,550
Or that I don't understand the law?

888
00:36:18,550 --> 00:36:19,150
No, no, no.

889
00:36:19,400 --> 00:36:20,480
That's not what I meant.

890
00:36:20,480 --> 00:36:21,710
I just wanted to be your assistant.

891
00:36:21,710 --> 00:36:23,400
Talk less, do less work,

892
00:36:23,420 --> 00:36:24,760
but still get paid the same.

893
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:25,760
How great is that!

894
00:36:25,960 --> 00:36:27,820
A person should know their place.

895
00:36:33,510 --> 00:36:35,000
That's actually the truth,

896
00:36:35,000 --> 00:36:35,800
truth indeed.

897
00:36:37,070 --> 00:36:37,630
Wang,

898
00:36:38,320 --> 00:36:39,060
are you okay?

899
00:36:39,110 --> 00:36:39,920
Do I look okay?

900
00:36:41,820 --> 00:36:42,680
What happened?

901
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:45,110
Look,

902
00:36:45,590 --> 00:36:47,440
last time you was hit with tomatoes,

903
00:36:47,440 --> 00:36:48,840
this time with eggs.

904
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:50,880
But if anyone deserves to be pelted,

905
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:51,800
it should be me.

906
00:36:52,160 --> 00:36:53,160
Calm down.

907
00:36:53,190 --> 00:36:54,050
Wait, Li Xiang.

908
00:36:54,710 --> 00:36:56,840
Did you go collect evidence yourself?

909
00:36:58,190 --> 00:36:58,850
Not really.

910
00:36:59,990 --> 00:37:01,590
Wei Sanmei's apology letter

911
00:37:02,230 --> 00:37:04,560
was voluntarily given to me by Wei Aiping.

912
00:37:07,240 --> 00:37:08,890
They are a couple after all.

913
00:37:08,920 --> 00:37:10,630
Family disputes are one thing,

914
00:37:10,630 --> 00:37:11,710
but she can't possibly wish

915
00:37:11,710 --> 00:37:12,960
her own husband dead.

916
00:37:13,110 --> 00:37:14,030
Do you think you are

917
00:37:14,030 --> 00:37:14,960
really capable?

918
00:37:15,810 --> 00:37:17,150
She didn't give that letter
to the procuratorate,

919
00:37:17,150 --> 00:37:18,230
she gave it only to you.

920
00:37:18,230 --> 00:37:18,960
To be honest,

921
00:37:19,150 --> 00:37:20,030
she trusts me.

922
00:37:20,840 --> 00:37:21,700
I'm very happy.

923
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:23,150
You shouldn't have taken it.

924
00:37:23,150 --> 00:37:24,880
She gave it to me—why wouldn't I take it?

925
00:37:24,880 --> 00:37:26,880
Let her give it to the procuratorate.

926
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:27,670
Wang,

927
00:37:28,110 --> 00:37:29,840
aren't we being a bit too cheap?

928
00:37:31,280 --> 00:37:32,670
They're prosecuting for the death penalty,

929
00:37:32,670 --> 00:37:33,800
and you insist on not guilty.

930
00:37:33,800 --> 00:37:34,590
They can't get the evidence,

931
00:37:34,590 --> 00:37:35,440
but you can.

932
00:37:36,160 --> 00:37:36,880
Isn't this openly

933
00:37:36,880 --> 00:37:37,630
slapping the procuratorate

934
00:37:37,630 --> 00:37:38,510
in the face?

935
00:37:40,030 --> 00:37:41,960
And you're dragging me into it too.

936
00:37:46,440 --> 00:37:46,960
Li,

937
00:37:47,510 --> 00:37:49,070
look at Wang's temper.

938
00:37:51,440 --> 00:37:52,920
If he's not willing to take it,

939
00:37:52,920 --> 00:37:53,980
then for this case,

940
00:37:54,320 --> 00:37:55,520
I'll team up with you.

941
00:38:07,230 --> 00:38:07,690
Come in.

942
00:38:08,710 --> 00:38:09,570
Director Hong.

943
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:10,400
Wang.

944
00:38:10,420 --> 00:38:11,030
Director Hong.

945
00:38:11,030 --> 00:38:11,440
Come.

946
00:38:12,210 --> 00:38:12,630
Fresh and warm.

947
00:38:12,630 --> 00:38:13,000
No,

948
00:38:13,000 --> 00:38:14,530
it's too dry. I might choke.

949
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:17,890
These are juicy.

950
00:38:20,190 --> 00:38:22,250
My comrade brought it from Xinjiang.

951
00:38:23,150 --> 00:38:24,230
Bursting with water with every bite.

952
00:38:24,230 --> 00:38:25,090
Just have some.

953
00:38:26,800 --> 00:38:27,190
Okay.

954
00:38:28,920 --> 00:38:30,120
Well, Director Hong,

955
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:32,210
about Qiao Zhiliang's case...

956
00:38:38,960 --> 00:38:39,510
Wang,

957
00:38:41,790 --> 00:38:43,450
my position remains the same.

958
00:38:44,070 --> 00:38:45,550
If whatever the procuratorate says

959
00:38:45,550 --> 00:38:46,610
is taken as gospel,

960
00:38:47,230 --> 00:38:49,110
then what on earth are we even here for?

961
00:38:49,110 --> 00:38:50,070
No, Director.

962
00:38:50,590 --> 00:38:51,440
Look,

963
00:38:51,810 --> 00:38:52,910
you're not a professional in this field,

964
00:38:52,910 --> 00:38:53,920
so there are many things

965
00:38:53,920 --> 00:38:55,190
you might not fully understand.

966
00:38:55,190 --> 00:38:56,650
I don't like hearing that.

967
00:38:56,670 --> 00:38:58,360
What do you mean I'm not a professional?

968
00:38:58,360 --> 00:38:58,630
I...

969
00:38:58,960 --> 00:38:59,800
Can't I learn?

970
00:39:02,070 --> 00:39:03,800
Legal Advisory Office, hello?

971
00:39:05,550 --> 00:39:06,440
Chief Liang.

972
00:39:07,110 --> 00:39:08,170
This is Zhansheng.

973
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:11,000
I'm listening,
please give your instructions.

974
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:12,260
Instructions my foot!

975
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:13,320
What the hell is your
Legal Advisory Office

976
00:39:13,320 --> 00:39:14,200
even doing?

977
00:39:14,630 --> 00:39:16,480
Why are you always going
against your superiors?

978
00:39:16,480 --> 00:39:17,940
Those two lawyers of yours

979
00:39:18,030 --> 00:39:19,280
pleaded not guilty

980
00:39:19,550 --> 00:39:21,000
for that rape-murder case.

981
00:39:21,000 --> 00:39:22,000
Did you know that?

982
00:39:26,510 --> 00:39:27,070
I know.

983
00:39:27,360 --> 00:39:28,960
You sound pretty proud of it.

984
00:39:29,150 --> 00:39:31,010
You instructed this, didn't you?

985
00:39:31,290 --> 00:39:32,750
For such a major criminal case,

986
00:39:32,750 --> 00:39:34,230
what position you should take,

987
00:39:34,230 --> 00:39:36,000
don't you have any idea?

988
00:39:37,230 --> 00:39:37,960
Liang Aimin.

989
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:38,400
You...

990
00:39:39,590 --> 00:39:40,120
Sit down.

991
00:39:40,280 --> 00:39:40,880
Sit down?

992
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:42,850
No, I wasn't telling you to sit down.

993
00:39:42,850 --> 00:39:44,110
Don't pull that crap with me.

994
00:39:44,110 --> 00:39:44,840
Liang Aimin.

995
00:39:45,480 --> 00:39:45,960
What?

996
00:39:45,960 --> 00:39:48,220
Bullying me because I don't know the law?

997
00:39:49,030 --> 00:39:50,880
Bullying me
because I'm not a professional?

998
00:39:50,880 --> 00:39:51,710
Can't I learn?

999
00:39:51,730 --> 00:39:53,130
I study every single day!

1000
00:39:53,630 --> 00:39:54,960
Our Legal Advisory Office

1001
00:39:54,960 --> 00:39:55,690
is not just for show,

1002
00:39:55,690 --> 00:39:57,510
and certainly not
the procuratorate's lapdog.

1003
00:39:57,510 --> 00:39:58,440
I'm telling you.

1004
00:39:58,550 --> 00:39:59,800
Don't just take

1005
00:39:59,800 --> 00:40:00,550
an outsider's side.

1006
00:40:00,550 --> 00:40:01,480
About that case,

1007
00:40:01,590 --> 00:40:03,000
as long as our lawyers think

1008
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:03,670
he's innocent,

1009
00:40:03,670 --> 00:40:04,690
they can plead not guilty for him.

1010
00:40:04,690 --> 00:40:05,490
What's wrong?

1011
00:40:05,710 --> 00:40:06,640
Hong Zhansheng,

1012
00:40:06,920 --> 00:40:08,250
are you trying to rebel?

1013
00:40:08,360 --> 00:40:09,400
I'll fire you.

1014
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,070
Hurry up!

1015
00:40:11,090 --> 00:40:11,840
Come over here!

1016
00:40:11,840 --> 00:40:12,960
You scared me to death!

1017
00:40:12,960 --> 00:40:13,490
Alright.

1018
00:40:13,510 --> 00:40:14,510
Fine, fine, fine.

1019
00:40:14,550 --> 00:40:16,030
Fine, fine, fine!

1020
00:40:17,840 --> 00:40:19,100
Who does he think he is?

1021
00:40:21,030 --> 00:40:22,020
I enlisted in 1962.

1022
00:40:22,020 --> 00:40:23,150
He enlisted in 1964.

1023
00:40:23,160 --> 00:40:24,200
Calling him Chief

1024
00:40:24,230 --> 00:40:25,190
is doing him a favor.

1025
00:40:25,190 --> 00:40:26,590
And he...

1026
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:33,360
Wang.

1027
00:40:34,000 --> 00:40:36,200
What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?

1028
00:40:36,230 --> 00:40:38,150
I've had diarrhea lately.

1029
00:40:38,960 --> 00:40:40,550
I don't want to defend this case.

1030
00:40:40,550 --> 00:40:41,600
I'm afraid my body can't take it.

1031
00:40:41,600 --> 00:40:42,070
No.

1032
00:40:42,920 --> 00:40:44,760
Don't eat tomatoes if you have diarrhea.

1033
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:45,420
Put it back.

1034
00:40:47,210 --> 00:40:48,540
I'll put it here for you.

1035
00:40:48,710 --> 00:40:50,280
All right, Director. I'll leave you to it.

1036
00:40:50,280 --> 00:40:51,280
I'll be going now.

1037
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:55,670
Wang.

1038
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:56,510
Wang.

1039
00:41:01,030 --> 00:41:01,590
Li Xiang.

1040
00:41:03,870 --> 00:41:05,070
What brings you here?

1041
00:41:07,150 --> 00:41:08,010
Please allow me

1042
00:41:09,070 --> 00:41:10,530
to pay my highest respects

1043
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:11,960
to Mr. Li.

1044
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:13,670
You

1045
00:41:14,150 --> 00:41:15,760
are the pride of Nanyu.

1046
00:41:17,630 --> 00:41:18,230
I...

1047
00:41:18,550 --> 00:41:19,440
I'm flattered.

1048
00:41:20,550 --> 00:41:21,280
To be honest,

1049
00:41:21,630 --> 00:41:22,230
this time,

1050
00:41:22,400 --> 00:41:23,400
I have to thank you

1051
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:25,070
for giving me this courage.

1052
00:41:25,070 --> 00:41:26,070
Thank us for what?

1053
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:28,070
In Qiu Agui's case,

1054
00:41:28,480 --> 00:41:29,740
you all encouraged me.

1055
00:41:29,800 --> 00:41:30,760
You showed me

1056
00:41:30,960 --> 00:41:33,160
what it means to pursue the impossible.

1057
00:41:33,230 --> 00:41:35,690
I'm filled with a sense of mission
right now.

1058
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:39,010
Let's go get a drink.

1059
00:41:39,070 --> 00:41:40,270
Let's go grab a drink.

1060
00:41:42,800 --> 00:41:43,530
Look at this.

1061
00:41:44,400 --> 00:41:45,960
The short one in the back,

1062
00:41:46,920 --> 00:41:48,120
does he look like him?

1063
00:41:48,590 --> 00:41:49,720
Feeling at ease now?

1064
00:41:50,080 --> 00:41:50,890
At least we can

1065
00:41:50,920 --> 00:41:52,200
return the file with confidence.

1066
00:41:52,200 --> 00:41:54,200
And no one can say anything about it.

1067
00:41:55,510 --> 00:41:56,970
I've already returned it.

1068
00:41:58,110 --> 00:42:00,710
The procuratorate also admitted
the evidence was insufficient,

1069
00:42:00,710 --> 00:42:02,190
and that our grounds were valid.

1070
00:42:02,190 --> 00:42:02,950
Liu Erlin

1071
00:42:03,550 --> 00:42:05,210
will be released in a few days.

1072
00:42:05,440 --> 00:42:05,960
Mentor.

1073
00:42:07,440 --> 00:42:08,230
You returned the file.

1074
00:42:08,230 --> 00:42:09,210
You should have told me.

1075
00:42:09,210 --> 00:42:09,670
I've been running around

1076
00:42:09,670 --> 00:42:10,800
every day lately.

1077
00:42:11,070 --> 00:42:11,870
What's wrong?

1078
00:42:12,230 --> 00:42:14,440
Feeling like you got the short end
of the stick

1079
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:16,040
and wasted the past few days?

1080
00:42:18,320 --> 00:42:19,280
It's not about that.

1081
00:42:19,280 --> 00:42:20,150
I just mean...

1082
00:42:20,440 --> 00:42:21,000
I...

1083
00:42:21,030 --> 00:42:23,030
This is just the beginning.

1084
00:42:24,510 --> 00:42:25,320
In the future,

1085
00:42:25,640 --> 00:42:26,960
you'll encounter many cases

1086
00:42:26,960 --> 00:42:28,150
where you work your tail off

1087
00:42:28,150 --> 00:42:30,480
but in the end,
there's nothing you can do.

1088
00:42:33,320 --> 00:42:34,520
Keep it as a souvenir.

1089
00:42:35,110 --> 00:42:36,840
Liu Erlin is lucky,

1090
00:42:37,630 --> 00:42:38,630
extremely lucky.

1091
00:42:39,840 --> 00:42:41,440
What about the unlucky ones?

1092
00:42:42,110 --> 00:42:43,280
Like Qiu Agui

1093
00:42:43,510 --> 00:42:45,040
and Qiao Zhiliang's cases,

1094
00:42:45,110 --> 00:42:45,840
what do we do?

1095
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:54,880
When you leave,

1096
00:42:54,880 --> 00:42:55,890
remember to close the door.
